Inputs are in the project's brief folder (your working directory):
- WHAT_WE_WANT.md (brief, audience, approved claims, rules)
- RESEARCH_PAIN.md (real customer complaints), if present
- persona/context files named in the brief
- the CANDIDATE named in the task: a script (stage "script"), or rendered frames whose filenames are timestamps plus an audio timeline (stage "animatic")
Judge only what a viewer would actually see and hear, never what the writer intended.
