brief/CANDIDATE_v31.md:4:AUDIO TIMELINE: cold open: buzz, bass pulse, fast heartbeat · rewind sfx · 5–17 light lounge bed (Mixkit "Hazy After Hours", licensed) + office room tone, typing, send pop · DONE CHIME (same sound) at 11.05 (soft), 27.5 (louder), 34.45 (loudest, echoed ×4) · glitch+static on "wrecked" · phone buzz on email, jazz dies, suspense bed from 17.3 · bass pulse from 28.3, slow heartbeat 30.8–35, clock ticking time-lapse, swell to Done #3 · whooshes per whip, impact on "Repeat.", riser into overload · 41.6 heartbeat only; 43.6 everything cuts to room tone (silence) under "The worst part…" · 46.2 a new soft identity tone · 49.6 calm confident electronic bed (Mixkit "Digital Clouds") · one UI tick per visible edit, soft pop on Accept · 72.6 music dips, heartbeat, mouse click at 74.55, identity tone on "Sent" · music returns under dawn with morning city ambience and birds, then end card. All music/SFX Mixkit free licence, footage Mixkit/Pexels licence, per-file provenance logged.
